    },
    "A JSON file with your settings, what the assistant remembers, cached events and chat history. Sign-in tokens are never included." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個 JSON 檔，包含你的設定、助理記得的事、快取的行程和聊天記錄。登入權杖絕不會包含在內。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new time applies to every event in the series. Their dates stay the same." : {
      "comment" : "Event page footnote when saving to all events of a series",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的時間會套用到這個重複行程的每一次，日期不變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A summary of the day's events, prepared ahead and refreshed whenever your calendar changes. The evening preview covers tomorrow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當天行程的摘要，事先準備好，行事曆有變動時就會更新。晚間預覽是明天的行程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
