    "Older messages are deleted automatically. At most the last 200 messages are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "較舊的訊息會自動刪除，最多保留最近 200 則訊息。"
