    },
    "On" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iOS 18, an event appears only if you open Smart Schedules within that time before it starts or while it's under way. On iOS 26 and later, it appears on time even when the app is closed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iOS 18 上，只有在行程開始前的這段時間內或行程進行中打開 Smart Schedules，行程才會出現。在 iOS 26 以上版本，即使沒有打開 App，行程也會準時出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iOS 18, the Smart Schedules server starts each one, which needs AI data sharing (Settings › AI & privacy). Without it, an event appears only when you open the app during that time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iOS 18 上，每個行程由 Smart Schedules 的伺服器啟動，因此需要在「設定 › AI 與隱私」允許 AI 資料分享。未允許時，只有在這段時間內打開 App，行程才會出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iOS 18, the titles, start and end times, event IDs and calendar colours of your events in the next 48 hours are also kept on the Smart Schedules server and sent through Apple's push service, so each one can appear in the Dynamic Island before it starts. Notes and places are not stored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iOS 18 上，接下來 48 小時內行程的標題、開始與結束時間、行程 ID 和行事曆顏色也會暫存在 Smart Schedules 的伺服器，並透過 Apple 的推播服務送出，讓每個行程在開始前出現在動態島。備註與地點不會儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iPhone 15 Pro and later: open the Settings app › Action Button, swipe to Shortcut, then choose Add to Smart Schedules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone 15 Pro 和後續機型：打開「設定」App › 動作按鈕，滑到「捷徑」，再選擇「加入 Smart Schedules」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
