    "Reminders from Smart Schedules let you reply, snooze or reschedule right in the notification. New events get no Google pop-ups, so your other devices won't alert you about them. Turn off notifications for the Google Calendar app on this iPhone to avoid duplicates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smart Schedules 的提醒可以直接在通知裡回覆、延後或改時間。新行程不會設定 Google 彈出式通知，所以你的其他裝置不會提醒這些行程。關閉這支 iPhone 上 Google 日曆 App 的通知，可以避免重複提醒。"
          }
