    },
    "This removes your settings, cached events, chat history, sign-in tokens, scheduled reminders and Live Activities from this iPhone and removes every Google account. Events in Google Calendar are not deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會從這支 iPhone 移除你的設定、快取的行程、聊天記錄、登入權杖、已排定的提醒和即時動態，並移除所有 Google 帳號。Google 日曆裡的行程不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes your settings, cached events, chat history, sign-in tokens, scheduled reminders and Live Activities from this iPhone and removes every Google account. Events in Google Calendar are not deleted. Subscriptions belong to your Apple Account and are not affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會從這支 iPhone 移除你的設定、快取的行程、聊天記錄、登入權杖、已排定的提醒和即時動態，並移除所有 Google 帳號。Google 日曆裡的行程不會被刪除。訂閱屬於你的 Apple 帳號，不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
