        }
      }
    },
    "Used when you don't ask for specific reminders. A one-off event, deadline or task added for later the same day gets 10 min before and at start instead. Google allows up to 5 per event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有指定提醒時使用。當天新增、當天稍後才開始的單次行程、截止日和待辦，改在 10 分鐘前和開始時提醒。Google 每個行程最多允許 5 個提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used when you don't ask for specific reminders. Google allows up to 5 per event." : {
