          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a day has more, the most important are sent: events starting now, then deadlines, other event reminders, tasks and routines. The rest are listed in that day's morning briefing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某天的提醒超過上限時，會先發送最重要的：行程開始時的提醒，接著是截止日、其他行程提醒、待辦事項和例行活動。其餘的會列在當天的早晨摘要裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the assistant adds events. Automatic uses My calendar of your first account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
